A||||41||Mattsfiero||An Awsome time at Kick Hill!!!!!||||6||
Z||000000||Mattsfiero||08-27-2000||01:29 PM||||Well we all had a great weekend. Saturday there were plenty of cars and people at the Kick Hill emporium in Lebonon, CT. I will tell you the place is a dream come true for all fiero owners....You name the part no matter how small and for what year, it was there for the Buying. The people there where great and very friendly. The event although hosted by Bob Parker the owner and Honorary member of NEFOA & MAFOA who hosted it was the greatest fun. I will post pictures of the event as I get them scanned.<P>Matt||||reg||6
Z||000001||TheFiero64||08-27-2000||02:56 PM||||I second that matt. It was great. NEFA had a great first event. The best part was crusing down to uncle d"s resturant. Seeing Fieros all in a row and hearing everyone shifting. There were a lot of heads turning from people as we passed. It was the best ever. Here is a link to the pics I took <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=36282&a=8396293" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=36282&a=8396293</A> <P>Please read <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003437.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003437.html</A> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif"> ||||reg||7
