Z||000024||Boomtastic||08-31-2000||07:56 PM||||We were supposed to have the person that made those name tags at the Kick Hill show, but sadly he couldn't make it. Next year (or even the next "show") we will have a registration booth and "goodie bag" for all those that attend. We may even have pre-registered people getting a name tag at the show! (Couldn't do it on the spot unless other arrangements were made ..) But all in good time! I'm glad that everyone had a blast. Now, what else can I dream up for all of us to do?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
