Z||000027||Eric_PA||09-02-2000||01:13 PM||||I wish I could have met more of you, but there was so much to see and so much to talk about. I was the one who went for a ride in the white pace car with the Quad 4 engine in it. Gerson was very nice to take me for a ride in it. I may be getting back in touch with him to buy it. I want to do this swap very badly, and allready have all the parts to do the swap, but his car was in great condition. I just don't know where I would store three Fieros and a Sunfire at my apartment. You never can own just one  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>Eric<BR>Black 86.5 GT<BR>||||reg||1
